From: conda-forge codex-feedstock
Subject: Increase codex-chatgpt query depth for newer rustc

Backport of https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/49706, also applied by
https://github.com/conda-forge/codex-feedstock.
Newer conda-forge rustc overflows its default query depth while computing
the layout of connectors::list_connectors().

--- a/codex-rs/chatgpt/src/lib.rs
+++ b/codex-rs/chatgpt/src/lib.rs
@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
+#![recursion_limit = "256"]
+
 pub mod apply_command;
 mod chatgpt_client;
 pub mod connectors;
